  <li>Double-click <strong><code>index.html</code></strong> to open it directly in Chrome, Edge, Firefox, or Safari.</li>
  <li>Or execute in PowerShell:
    <br/><code>Start-Process "C:\Users\ADMIN\.gemini\antigravity\scratch\ragebaiting\index.html"</code>
